From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:23:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/54] hw/display/pvg: 1D/2D-array/3D/cube textures,
 attachment feedback snapshots

Textures carry their MTLTextureType, layers, depth and slice stride; host
images and views follow it. A shader sampling its own colour attachment
gets a copy taken before the draw (rendering is suspended around the copy).
Upload failures are logged; imageCubeArray enabled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
